// Five Flags Country Screener — Dataset
// Scores are on a 1-10 scale (10 = most favorable for the flag holder).
// Compiled from public regulatory sources (OECD CRS lists, Henley Passport Index 2025/26,
// Nomad Capitalist rankings, national tax authority sites, CoinGecko crypto regs tracker,
// Numbeo/InterNations lifestyle indices). Figures are directional — verify before acting.
//
// Dimensions (Five Flags Theory adapted to 8 axes):
//   tax_residency   — Ease of establishing tax residency (days, nomad visas, simplicity)
//   territorial_tax — Favorability of the tax regime (territorial, zero, lump-sum, etc.)
//   banking         — Access & quality of banking for non-residents / new residents
//   crs             — Low CRS exposure (10 = not in CRS / weak enforcement; 1 = full CRS enforcer)
//   crypto          — Crypto-friendliness (regulation clarity + low tax + fiat ramps)
//   fiat_ramps      — Ease of moving money in/out (USD/EUR rails, exchanges, cards)
//   travel          — Passport / residence travel usefulness (visa-free score)
//   lifestyle       — Lifestyle quality (safety, healthcare, climate, cost, English)
//
// Each country also includes: region, tax_model, visa_free_count, notes, tags[]

